#: templates/report.html.j2:219
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"in the %(w)s window. Positive → extra Auto Mode activity after the meal; "
"it can fit a too-weak CR, but is not specific to that.\n"
"    <b>CR (CHO/bolus)</b> = CHO / meal bolus only (not the pump’s "
