"⚠︎ = contaminated window (another meal &lt;%(w)s afterwards). ⚠︎ H = a "
"hypo rescue (small carbs, no bolus, low BG) in the window. ⚠︎ G = CGM gap"
" over 25 min in the window (excluded from the clean median when enough "
"other meals exist)."
